# The Moonlit Path (windurst 9): the item bits. Accepted with the Whisper of the Moon (GM), holding all five reward items:
# 846 with mask 223 (bits 0-4, and 6 and 7); option 2 (Fenrir's Cape, held, rare): giveItem fails, nothing, the quest
# stays accepted, the whisper kept.
lists WindurstWaters/Leepe-Hoppe/onTrigger WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/846
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=11.4,-9.75,-195.97
fame Windurst 425
quest Windurst.TheMoonlitPath accepted
keyitem WhisperOfTheMoon
item FenrirsStone
item FenrirsCape
item FenrirsTorque
item FenrirsEarring
item AncientsKey
login
trigger Leepe-Hoppe                     # 846 (mask 223)
finish option=2                         # the cape held: giveItem fails, nothing
trigger Leepe-Hoppe                     # still accepted, the whisper kept: 846
finish
